OL,3,CRough sleeping up by 23% according to
OL,4,Clatest figures
OL,6,FThere has been an increase in
OL,7,Findividuals moving into long-term
OL,8,Faccommodation when comparing May 2025
OL,9,Fto May 2026 - 631 compared to 667 this
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe Prime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,13,Frecently pledged that his government
OL,14,Fwill end rough sleeping in England.
OL,16,FIn response to the figures, The
OL,17,FWallich - a rough sleeping and
OL,18,Fhomelessness charity said the figures
OL,19,Fdemonstrate why action is needed.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
