OL,3,CRough sleeping up by 23% according to
OL,4,Clatest figures
OL,6,FThe CEO, Sian Aldridge said: "With
OL,7,Fhousing being devolved to Wales, and
OL,8,Fthe #340 million pledge by the Burnham
OL,9,Fgovernment only relevant to England,
OL,10,Fwe need to make sure Wales keeps the
OL,11,Fsame focus".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
