OL,3,CRough sleeping up by 23% according to
OL,4,Clatest figures
OL,6,FMs Aldridge also said that the Welsh
OL,7,FGovernment's Homelessness and Social
OL,8,FHousing Allocation is a good start for
OL,9,Fchange but "the new Welsh Government
OL,10,Fneeds to see through its commitment to
OL,11,Fimplementing the Act, ensuring no
OL,12,Fwrong door to accessing help, and
OL,13,Finvesting into the Housing Support and
OL,14,FPrevention budget which provides that
OL,15,Fhelp".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/6
