OL,3,CRough sleeping up by 23% according to
OL,4,Clatest figures
OL,6,FShe continued: "We hope to see a
OL,7,Frefreshed Welsh Government Action Plan
OL,8,Fwith a clear roadmap to ending
OL,9,Fhomelessness. It also must deliver on
OL,10,Fits commitment to deliver 20,000
OL,11,Fsocial homes by 2030, because we have
OL,12,Fa severe lack of homes in Wales that
OL,13,Fpeople can afford."
OL,15,FThe Welsh Government has been
OL,16,Fapproached for a comment.
